<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
        <style>
            body {
                font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
                margin: 0;
                padding: 0;
                box-sizing: border-box;
            }
            .header {
                text-align: center;
                margin-bottom: 20px;
                padding: 20px;
            }
            .header img {
                max-width: 250px;
            }
            .content {
                padding: 20px;
                margin-bottom: 100px;
            }
            table {
                width: 100%;
                border-collapse: collapse;
                margin-top: 20px;
            }
            th,
            td {
                border: 1px solid #000;
                padding: 10px;
                text-align: left;
            }
            th {
                background-color: #f2f2f2;
            }
        </style>
    </head>
    <body>
        <div class="header">
            <img src="data:image/png;base64,{{ logo }}" alt="Logo CLCOM">
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            {% set invoice = creditNote.invoice %}
            {% set billing = invoice.billingDataSnapshot %}
            <p style="margin-left: 60%; margin-bottom: 100px; background-color: #ebebeb; padding: 10px">
                {{ billing.name|default('') }}<br>
                {% if billing.company is defined and billing.company %}{{ billing.company }}<br>{% endif %}
                {{ billing.address|default('') }}<br>
                {{ billing.postalCode|default('') }} {{ billing.city|default('') }}
            </p>

            <p>
                <strong>Avoir N°:</strong>
                {{ creditNote.number }}
                du
                {{ creditNote.issuedAt|date('d/m/Y') }}
                - {{ creditNote.site.name }}
                <br>
                <strong>En annulation de la facture N°:</strong>
                {{ invoice.number }}
                <br>
                <strong>Inscription N°:</strong>
                {{ invoice.registration.id }}
            </p>

            <table style="margin-top: 70px;">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Libellé</th>
                        <th>Montant</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Avoir - {{ creditNote.reason|default('Désinscription') }} ({{ invoice.registration.fareLabel }})</td>
                        <td>-{{ creditNote.amount|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} €</td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>

            <p style="text-align: right; margin-top: 100px;">
                <strong>Total montant TTC :</strong> -{{ creditNote.amount|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} €<br>
            </p>

            <p style="margin-top: 60px;">
                Aucun remboursement n'est effectué automatiquement par cet avoir : le remboursement, s'il est dû, est traité manuellement par nos équipes.
            </p>
        </div>
    </body>
</html>
